    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 DEATH GAME HOTEL \u2013 High-Stakes VR Poker Like Never Before!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Game Hotel is an intense VR poker battle, blending high-risk gambling with survival. Face off in Death Poker, where you bet more than chips\u2014you risk your body parts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.poster.avif?t=1755575786\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.webm?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.mp4?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Death Poker \u2013 Raise the Stakes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twisted take on Texas Hold\u2019em with a deadly new \u2018Death\u2019 suit:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strongest Hand \u2192 Hands with a Death card Weakest Hand \u2192 Can\u2019t use Death? You lose. Go All In \u2192 Bet chips\u2026 or your hands, eyes, or ears Can you handle the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/247e39496b5d21fb801a0ba4ce53c300.avif?t=1755575786\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Goblet of the Reaper \u2013 Deadly Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop stone slabs into the goblet\u2014don\u2019t let it overflow! Spill too much, and the Reaper arrives for a life-or-death showdown. 1v1 mode intensifies the mind games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/337ebcc17586f9b7841ca60b4a7c36e3.poster.avif?t=1755575786\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/337ebcc17586f9b7841ca60b4a7c36e3.webm?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/337ebcc17586f9b7841ca60b4a7c36e3.mp4?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd25 Cheat Your Way to Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use VR-exclusive tricks to gain an edge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Poker \u2192 Swap cards, peek at the next draw Goblet of the Reaper \u2192 Prevent spills, track slab counts If you don\u2019t get caught, it\u2019s not cheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/fd04cb9558e43dd3fdb49e4783222e60.poster.avif?t=1755575786\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/fd04cb9558e43dd3fdb49e4783222e60.webm?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/fd04cb9558e43dd3fdb49e4783222e60.mp4?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Multiplayer &amp; Solo Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6-player matches with real-time bluffing 20-player social lobbies Single-Player Mode: Death Game 2000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/050cea7d72c3e14217f654ef0f0688fe.avif?t=1755575786\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Free to Play \u2013 Download Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freemium model\u2014no purchase required Solo Mode: Death Slot for high-risk fun \ud83c\udfb2 Are you ready to risk it all? Download now and play for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/6a0bcbc98839c56840629a3ccefbdabb.poster.avif?t=1755575786\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/6a0bcbc98839c56840629a3ccefbdabb.webm?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/6a0bcbc98839c56840629a3ccefbdabb.mp4?t=1755575786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 SWERY and the devs might join the game on weekends\u2026 will you face them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
